# Deployment Checklist

## Pre-Deployment
- [ ] Tests passing
- [ ] Security review (if required)
- [ ] Code reviewed
- [ ] CHANGELOG updated

## Environment
- [ ] Env vars configured
- [ ] Secrets set
- [ ] DB migrations ready
- [ ] Rollback plan known

## Deploy
- [ ] Notify team
- [ ] Run migrations (if any)
- [ ] Deploy application
- [ ] Health check passes

## Post-Deploy
- [ ] Monitor errors (15 min)
- [ ] Verify key flows
- [ ] Notify completion

## Rollback If
- Error rate >2x baseline
- Critical feature broken
- Security issue found

See: @.claude/runbooks/rollback.md
